class Solution {
    public int addDigits(int num) {
        while (num >= 10) {
            int sum = 0;
            int temp = num;
            while (temp > 0) { 
                sum += temp % 10; 
                temp /= 10; 
            }
            num = sum; 
        }
        return num;
    }
}

Example 1:

Input: num = 38
Output: 2
Explanation: The process is
38 --> 3 + 8 --> 11
11 --> 1 + 1 --> 2 
Since 2 has only one digit, return it.
